1. SCOPE

   This licence covers the software and materials of the Warfare project made by
   the rights holder: the warfaremapskits, warfaredecor and sadecor mods (source,
   compiled classes, textures, models, sounds, language files, configuration), the
   Warfare launcher and its source, the project site, the pack manifest and the
   publishing tools, and the composition of the modpack itself (mod list, configs,
   map presets, kits, shop, voice lines) as a work in its own right.

2. PERMITTED

   - Downloading and running the client to play on the rights holder's servers.
   - Keeping a private backup of what you downloaded.
   - Talking about the project, showing it in videos or streams, linking to it.

3. NOT PERMITTED WITHOUT WRITTEN PERMISSION

   - Redistributing, re-uploading, mirroring, selling, or bundling any of the files
     in section 1, in whole or in part.
   - Publishing them anywhere (Modrinth, CurseForge, GitHub, file hosts, forums,
     chat channels, and so on).
   - Using the code or any part of it, the assets, the texts or the configuration in
     another project.
   - Decompiling, deobfuscating or otherwise taking the software apart in order to
     reuse it, port it, make a derivative work, or work around this licence.
   - Removing or altering the authorship, licence or build-fingerprint notices.
   - Running a public server on this software.

4. DECOMPILATION IS NOT A LICENCE

   Java always allows the bytecode to be read. Being technically able to do so
   grants no rights to the code and is not permission to use it. Source recovered
   that way remains the rights holder's work.

5. NO WARRANTY

   The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The rights holder
   is not liable for any damage arising from its use.

6. PROOF OF AUTHORSHIP

   Every build of the mod carries META-INF/warfare-build.properties (project,
   author, licence and a permanent build-line id), META-INF/LICENSE.txt (this text)
   and the authors/license fields in META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml. A copy found
   elsewhere with those files is demonstrably this project's; a copy with the
   fingerprint stripped but the same code is itself evidence.

7. THIRD PARTIES

   This licence does not cover other people's work the project builds on: NeoForge
   and its MDK (build scripts, templates), Minecraft, libraries and mods by other
   authors (superbwarfare, TACZ, Curios, GeckoLib and others) or third-party assets.
   Their own licences apply and continue to apply. The TEMPLATE_LICENSE.txt shipped
   with the NeoForge MDK is a placeholder the MDK asks you to replace; it has been
   replaced by this file and does not apply to this project.
